.TH "RAPTOR-CONVERT" 1 "2026-10" "RAPTOR Studio" "RAPTOR Studio Manual"
.SH NAME
raptor\-convert \- Write IN as OUT in the format OUT's extension names (or \-\-to). Refuses a lossy conversion unless \-\-allow\-lossy.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBraptor convert\fR [\-h] [\-\-to {rbd,rbds}] [\-\-allow\-lossy] IN OUT
.SH DESCRIPTION
Write IN as OUT in the format OUT's extension names (or \-\-to). Refuses a lossy conversion unless \-\-allow\-lossy.
.SH OPTIONS
.SS Options
.TP
\fB\-\-to\fR \fI{rbd|rbds}\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-allow\-lossy\fR
\&.rbds\-only content (annotations, experiment settings, rate definitions) is dropped in .rbd
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBraptor\fR(1)
